  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人工智慧導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE",
    "describe_ch": "近年來人工智慧與大數據等資料科學技術已廣泛應用在各個領域，作為資料科學的基礎，人工智慧就不得不被提及，因此，本課程將不僅著重在人工智慧理論的教授也著重在實作的部分，利用現有的工具如：python+spark，讓學生透過實作來了解人工智慧背後的原理及應用。",
    "describe_eh": "Artificial intelligence and big data has been widely applied in data science area. As the foundation of data science techniques, artificial intelligence is desired to be known. Therefore, this course focuses on not only the theoretical concepts but also the real-world applications of artificial intelligence. Using existing tools, such as python & spark, the students can easily perform the artificial intelligence and realize the theoretical concepts and its applications.",
